# Variaveis de ambiente

## Backend local

```bash
PORT=8080
APP_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGIN_PATTERNS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000,http://localhost:3001,http://127.0.0.1:3001,https://*.onrender.com
```

## Frontend local

```bash
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api
```

## Docker local

```bash
API_URL=http://backend:8080/api
```

## Render

Backend:

```bash
APP_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGIN_PATTERNS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000,http://localhost:3001,http://127.0.0.1:3001,https://*.onrender.com
```

Frontend:

```bash
VITE_API_URL=https://senai-testes-api.onrender.com/api
```

Observacao: usando `render.yaml`, o `VITE_API_URL` e preenchido automaticamente a partir da URL publica do servico da API.
